# godot-correctness-mcp

This is the godot-correctness-mcp repository: an offline static correctness MCP server (and `gdcorrect` CLI) for Godot 4.x GDScript projects.

## Project structure

- `src/` -- TypeScript source (`tools/` MCP registration, `lint/` GDScript rules, `scenes/` scene/project/registry checks, `symbols/` API DB lookup/diff)
- `data/` -- committed symbol DBs and grammar WASM
- `package.json` -- npm package manifest

## Conventions

- Use conventional commits (feat:, fix:, chore:, docs:)
- Bump the version in package.json with `npm version <level> --no-git-tag-version`; CI tags and publishes it
- Regenerate mcp-tools.json with `npm run generate:tools` after changing tools
- Lint rules live in src/lint/rules/; tools live in src/tools/
